A valkyrie should really have no troubles with her +1 long sword until
far into the dungeon. It should easily suffice until you reach dungeon
level 20 or something like that.

If you want a better weapon, though, look for an altar (shown as _ in
the dungeon). When you find one (and there is no priest of another god
there), start #offer-ing monsters you just killed (you must offer them
less than 50 turns after killing them).

With every offer you make, there is a chance of your god giving you an
artifact weapon. The first one given will always be Mjollnir (Thor's war
hammer), which does lots of normal damage, and an added lot of
electrical damage.

Continued offering will also get your in-game luck up, but that will
gradually get lower if you don't take precautions.

